QuestGuidance.Register("en",250,{
[7969]="7005A67C\n1\tPolish dusty mirror traps (total: 12)\tMirror traps can be found west of Maergrind. You should polish any dusty mirror traps that you find.\n2\tCompleted\tPolished dusty mirror traps.\n",
[7970]="70027F1B\n1\tTrack the half-orc emissary to make sure he is not causing trouble\tThe half-orc emissary retreated southwards towards the White Hand encampment, probably following the road. You should follow the emissary and make sure that he does not plan to attack Lhan Tarren after being insulted by Riagán.\n2\tIt can only be hoped that Guto and Elain are safe at least, since they were not there during the attack. You should seek them in Lhan Tarren and try to help recover from the attack by the White Hand.\t\n3\tSpeak with Guto\tGuto is in Lhan Tarren. You should speak with Guto.\n",
[7971]="7006EC43\n1\tFly a kite on the southern beach\030Fly a kite near the southern cove\030Fly a kite at the west end of the harbour\030Fly a kite atop the eastern bridge\030Fly a kite on the sand in front of the inn\tTâlugar has asked you to fly a kite in the more populated areas of the island so that people can see your kite and be inspired to buy one of their own.\n2\tTalk to Tâlugar\tPer Tâlugar's request, you have flown a kite in the more populated areas of the island so that people can see your kite and be inspired to buy one of their own. You should return to Tâlugar on the south side of Furtherholm's harbour to collect your reward.\n",
[7972]="7003ADB9\n1\tUse the map to rally to Théoden's summons\tYou have been given a map to guide you to Théoden's side. You should read the map and go to Théoden at once.\n2\tWitness the last stand of the Rohirrim\tThéoden is in the Great Hall of the Hornburg. You should witness the end of the siege on Helm's Deep.\n3\tSpeak with Théoden\tThéoden is in the Great Hall of the Hornburg. You should speak with Théoden.\n",
[7973]="70047A85\n1\tCollect poisonous goo (total: 8)\tMaggot larvae can be found within the caverns of Skoironk. You should collect poisonous goo from the maggot larvae in Skoironk.\n2\tSpeak with Thurindol\tThurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills. You should speak with Thurindol.\n",
[7974]="70058C8A\n1\tTalk to Léothred at Hlithseld\tLéothred can be found at Hlithseld. You should talk to Léothred at Hlithseld.\n",
[7975]="70040B0B\n1\tCollect corsair orders\tCorsair orders can be found on the bodies of corsair footmen throughout Belfalas. Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what Captain Tabadam of Makham Mijann is planning.\n2\tCollect corsair orders (total: 8)\tCorsair orders can be found on the bodies of corsair footmen throughout Belfalas. Collecting orders from fallen corsairs may give more insight as to what Captain Tabadam of Makham Mijann is planning.\n3\tBring the corsair orders to Bruidis in Tadrent\tBruidis can be found in the village of Tadrent. You should bring the corsair orders to Bruidis so that she can look through the information you've gathered.\n",
[7976]="70030866\n1\tClear foliage to allow light in\tTrees with dense foliage are no longer held in place by the shadows, and can be encouraged to let the light in for the first time in a long age.\n2\tClear foliage to allow light in (total: 3)\tTrees that block the light can be found throughout the Black Heart of Fangorn. Trees with dense foliage are no longer held in place by the shadows, and can be encouraged to let the light in for the first time in a long age.\n3\tTalk to Greenroot\tGreenroot has appeared behind you while you let the light in. You should speak with Greenroot.\n4\tFind the last sleeping Ent\tYou should press further into Fangorn, towards the sunlight you see in the distance to the south-west of this grove.\n",
[7977]="7004DC13\n1\tTalk to MadeOfLions\tTalk to MadeOfLions to complete Volume IV, Book 9 and the first four chapters of the Black Book of Mordor!\n",
[7978]="70054FBE\n1\tTalk to MadeOfLions\tTalk to MadeOfLions to complete chapters 5-8 of the Black Book of Mordor\n",
